esphome-xteink

The ESPHome glue in components/xteink/*.py, *.h, *.cpp is MIT licensed (see LICENSE).

components/xteink/sdk/libs is an unmodified, sparse copy of the FreeInk SDK
(https://github.com/Free-Ink/freeink-sdk, MIT) at the commit recorded in
components/xteink/sdk/SDK_COMMIT. Its own LICENSE and NOTICE are kept alongside
it. FreeInk is itself derived from the OpenX4 E-Paper Community SDK
(https://github.com/open-x4-epaper/community-sdk, MIT); the SSD1677 driver and
panel waveforms originate with CidVonHighwind and that community.

The first ESPHome integration of these drivers was ngxson/esphome-component-xteink
(MIT), whose display/buttons/battery YAML shape this project keeps compatible.
